H / C: letters differ false, wheelchair false
AA / BB: letters differ false, wheelchair false
WC / C: letters differ false, wheelchair true
C / WC: letters differ false, wheelchair true
WC / WC: letters differ false, wheelchair false
WC1 / C: letters differ false, wheelchair true
ADA / C: letters differ false, wheelchair true
Wheelchair / C: letters differ false, wheelchair true
W / C: letters differ false, wheelchair false
12 / 8: letters differ false, wheelchair false
12 / B: letters differ false, wheelchair false
